---
/* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Tucson, AZ — temporarily closed.

   Tucson is raised on 179 of 571 Buena Vista calls (31%), the single biggest
   topic in the export after the core levels of care. Of those callers, ~60%
   want to stay in southern Arizona, ~26% raise transport or distance, and ~28%
   end up being referred to another Tucson programme. The page mirrors what
   admissions already does: two routes, given equal weight.

   INDEXING — this page is deliberately INDEXED, which diverges from the "build
   noindex" note in the sitemap. Reasoning: people search for Buena Vista Tucson
   because it operated there for years, and noindexing means the only answers
   they find are stale third-party listings that still show it as open. An
   honest page ranking for those searches deflects the call and keeps the
   relationship. To reverse, add `noindex={true}` to the Layout below.

   It carries NO LocalBusiness schema on purpose, so it does not compete with
   Chandler as an active location entity. Status is stated as temporarily
   closed, matching how a closed location should be represented.

   WHEN TUCSON REOPENS: add LocalBusiness schema with the NAP and hours, swap
   the closed badge and greyscale image, flip `open: true` in LocationSection,
   and restore the Tucson address in the about page schema.

   STYLE: closure is stated as a fact and immediately paired with a route
   forward — never as a refusal. No call-data sourcing in the copy.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import TopBar from '../../components/TopBar.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';

import TucsonHero from '../../components/tucson/TucsonHero.astro';
import TucsonOptions from '../../components/tucson/TucsonOptions.astro';
import TucsonQuestions from '../../components/tucson/TucsonQuestions.astro';

import Testimonials from '../../components/Testimonials.astro';
import VerifySection from '../../components/VerifySection.astro';
import FinalCTA from '../../components/FinalCTA.astro';

const title = 'Buena Vista Tucson, AZ — Temporarily Closed | Buena Vista Health & Recovery';
const description =
  'Our Tucson, AZ facility is temporarily closed. Detox and residential treatment continue at our Chandler facility, and we will help southern Arizona find local care. Call (888) 362-5576.';

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: [
    ['Is Buena Vista Tucson closed?',
     'Yes, temporarily. The facility at 5151 E Pima St is not admitting while work toward reopening continues. The Chandler, AZ facility is open and admitting 24 hours a day.'],
    ['When will Buena Vista Tucson reopen?',
     'A date will be announced once it is confirmed. Admissions can say where it stands on any given day, and take your details to let you know when it changes.'],
    ['How far is the Chandler facility from Tucson?',
     'Roughly a two-hour drive north on the I-10. Airport pickup is provided for anyone flying in, and admissions will work through other travel arrangements with you.'],
    ['Can Buena Vista help me find treatment in Tucson?',
     'Yes. If travelling to Chandler is not realistic, admissions will check your coverage and help you find a programme in southern Arizona that accepts it, at no cost.'],
  ].map(([q, a]) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: q,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: a },
  })),
};
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <TopBar />
  <Nav />

  <TucsonHero />
  <TucsonOptions />
  <Testimonials />
  <VerifySection />
  <TucsonQuestions />

  <FinalCTA />

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} is:inline />
</Layout>
